  "steps": [
    "To a bowl add 240g high protien yogurt, 120g unsweetened peanut butter, 100g honey, Mix it well, Scoop the mixture into 8 small bites, And freeze for at least 1 hour.",
    "Once they’re fully frozen, dip each one into melted dark chocolate (150g) and watch it instantly coat into a smooth glossy shell.",
